  "_swamp": "Swamp regions (cooks/biome-swamp.md 2.12.3): side swamp, zones = the swamp sub-zone letters (Data/swamp.json zones: 1 Reed Flats, 2 Mangrove Thickets, 3 Rotting Boardwalks, 4 Murk Pools, 5 Bone Mounds), day table creatures, night table night. murkjaw_young comes out on M1 nights and keeps to the channel mouths (WRSwampCreatures). Hexcrows are diurnal: in a night table they roost (asleep, a noise wakes them).",
  "_graveyard": "Graveyard regions (cooks/biome-graveyard.md 2.12.3): side graveyard, zones = the Graveyard sub-zone letters (Data/lands/graveyard.json zoneGrid: 1 the Grave Fields, 2 the Mausoleum Rows, 3 the Bone Pits, 4 Chapel Heights, n the neck, r Rootgrave), the day table in creatures and the night table in night. Gravehounds in G1 by day lie buried in their dens (WRGraveCreatures). The catacombs' tables (G5 L1, L2, L3) are the dens in their rooms (tuning graveyardLife.catacombs).",
  "_forest": "Ancient forest regions (cooks/biome-forest.md 2.12.3): side forest, zones = the forest sub-zone letters (Data/forest.json zones: 1 Meadows and Farmland, 2 Streams and Falls, 3 Grovekin Villages, 4 Old-Growth Groves, 5 Elder Canopy), the day table in creatures and the night table in night. The cook's Bramblewasp nests weights are the wandering scout pairs here (bramblewasp pack 2-3); the swarms come out of the nests themselves (WRForestHazards). The living-world beats (WRForestCreatures UWRForestLife) move what these spawn: Thornlynx onto trunks over the elk trails at dusk, Rootcoils across the fords, wasp raids at noon, finch flocks over kills.",
  "_storm": "Storm peaks regions (cooks/biome-lightning.md 2.9 Where): side storm_peaks, zones = the Storm peaks sub-zone letters they live in (storm_peaks.json zones: 1 Wind Passes, 2 Cliff Paths, 3 Rope Bridges, 4 Struck Crags, 5 Cliff Shrines), storm = the table while a Thunderstorm is on (the Raiju only comes then).",
  "_night": "night: the region's table after dusk (cooks/build-world-systems.md 2.9, fire-frost 3.3.7 / 3.4.7). A kind only in creatures (the day table) lies up at night; a kind only in night lies up by day (its pack isn't brought out near players); a kind in both is out at all hours. New packs roll from the table of the hour. A whiteout runs the night table by day (world.json events)."
